      "font_size": 40,
      "text_bbox": [
        75,
        2335,
        2887,
        2421
      ],
      "text": "Above, the Argive reinforcement. Below, Thessalian horsemen on the field where they changed sides. Both scenes imagine the terrain and\npositions around Tanagra."
